              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahitofeli abwira Abusalomu ati “Taha ku nshoreke za so yasize mu rugo, maze Abisirayeli bose bazamenya ko wazinutswe so cyane. Nuko abazaba bari kumwe nawe bose bazahama bakomere.” ",
          "type": "text",
